Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 06:55:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] gui(app-boot): packaged-install heal + @dsh-gui profile
 layer deploy

- healProfilesModuleFallback: seed junction preference with byte-freshness
  (manifest + runtime entry + served client bundle), materialization fallback
  on win32, per-package resilience, completion stamp
- client web plugins from asar @dsh-gui scope folded into links
- native packages from app.asar.unpacked added to links
- ensureGuiBrowserPluginsProfileLayer: deploy every @dsh-gui browser plugin
  (entity copy + junction + byte drift refresh) into the profile layer
- keep ensureMcpCatalogPatchEntry for the mcp-catalog host-half mount
